## Notes from Revision Process

- Feedback from Gens Chemistry Ltd.'s leadership emphasized the need to strike a positive and confident tone while addressing the allegations.
- Legal counsel advised against admitting liability or confirming specific allegations until the internal investigation is completed.
- Messaging was adjusted to highlight sustainability investments and proactive measures taken since 2022.
- Phrases referring to discrepancies in historical data were softened to avoid fueling speculation or negative media narratives.

## Pending Approval

- Awaiting final review and sign-off from Gens Chemistry Ltd.'s CEO and Bertrand and Co.'s senior PR team.
- Edits may be required based on feedback from legal counsel and key investors.

---

## Internal Reminders

- Ensure all communications comply with regulatory guidelines and avoid speculative statements.
- Confirm the accuracy of all data points included in the press release.
- Coordinate with cybersecurity team to ensure secure document sharing during the review process.
